# Benchmark results — CSVs in results/ are gitignored by default, with explicit
# exceptions below for the four sample CSVs that ship with the repo (so the
# dashboard has data when someone clones).
#
# We use `results/*.csv` instead of `results/` so git still descends into the
# directory and can apply the `!` negation rules to specific files.
results/*.csv
results/*.log
*.log

!results/hf_tinyllama.csv
!results/vllm_tinyllama.csv
!results/vllm_mistral-7b_awq_generic.csv
!results/vllm_mistral-7b_awq_marlin.csv

# Database files
*.db
*.sqlite
postgres-data/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db